<title>SINGAPORE: India awards seven cargoes of Dubai in Sep tender.</title>
<headline>India awards seven cargoes of Dubai in Sep tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) awarded seven cargoes of Dubai crude in its tender to buy September crudes, traders said on Monday.</p>
</text>
